  "solution": "Let \\(P(x)=x^3-20x^2+18x-7\\), with roots \\(r,s,t\\).\n\nUsing \\((1+r)(1+s)(1+t)\\), expand:\n\\[\n(1+r)(1+s)(1+t)=1+(r+s+t)+(rs+rt+st)+rst.\n\\]\n\nBy Vieta’s formulas:\n\\[\nr+s+t=20,\\quad rs+rt+st=18,\\quad rst=7.\n\\]\n\nSo,\n\\[\n(1+r)(1+s)(1+t)=1+20+18+7=46.\n\\]\n\nThe answer is 46.",
